  "description": "DAX cells for ClrKernel: query Analysis Services Tabular models and Microsoft Fabric / Power BI semantic models from a notebook with `#!dax`, against named cubes registered by `#!dax-connect`, with results rendered as an interactive grid. Includes DAX completion and hover for the editor. Drives the `#!dax` cell language across the Jupyter kernel, the JSON-RPC server, and the headless runner; connections, metadata and model processing live in ClrKernel.Database.Provider.AnalysisServices.",
